  "Click a card to flip it. Earned mascot cards can be your avatar.": "Fes clic en una carta per girar-la. Les cartes de mascota que hagis aconseguit poden ser el teu avatar.",
  "Click a completed level on the map, then choose Replay. You can try for a better result at your own pace.": "Fes clic en un nivell superat al mapa i tria Repetir. Pots intentar millorar el resultat al teu ritme.",
